{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5972","title":"Xiaomi Unveils Xiaomi 17, Xiaomi 17 Ultra, and Leica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi: Masterpiece Flagship Mobile Imaging with Essential Leica Imagery","desc":"Xiaomi today unveiled its next-generation Xiaomi 17 Series, showcasing the company's latest advances in mobile technology. ","view_cnt":"16116","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1772188161","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/696_operatorx_operatorx_opx/27/02/2026/4fd82aee5ffd22b35fab5acabb097989.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e[\u003cstrong\u003eBarcelona, Spain, February 28, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e] - Xiaomi today unveiled its next-generation Xiaomi 17 Series, showcasing the company's latest advances in mobile technology. Xiaomi Pad 8 Series, Xiaomi's latest flagship tablets, and a selection of Smart on the Go AIoT products were also introduced — including Xiaomi Scooter 6 Series and Xiaomi Watch 5 — further expanding Xiaomi's connected ecosystem. Showcasing its design ambition, Xiaomi also introduced Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo, a visionary electric hypercar concept created for the legendary \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e franchise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a core focus of today's announcement, Xiaomi also unveiled a major evolution of its partnership with Leica. The collaboration has been elevated from a highly successful Joint R\u0026amp;D framework to a new Strategic Co-creation Model, reflecting a deeper, end-to-end partnership.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt under this upgraded model, Xiaomi 17 Ultra and Leica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi set a new benchmark for mobile photography, combining flagship-level imaging performance with sleek form factors and durable, ergonomically refined designs. Backed by over a century of Leica imaging expertise, the Xiaomi 17 Series delivers a complete flagship smartphone experience, with industry-leading photo and video capabilities at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTimeless Design Behind Unparalleled Xiaomi Guardian Structure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/436_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/a45c8c14ec8f2c73ccfdb6a84ed9c8ca.jpg\" alt=\"Three Xiaomi smartphones are displayed side by side, in colors white, black, and green. Each phone has a large circular camera module on the back, containing multiple lenses and the LEICA logo. The design of the phones is simple and modern.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Xiaomi 17 Series features a minimalist design that prioritises elegance and a professional look. Clean lines, smooth edges, and a streamlined layout create a simple, confident appearance that reflects the series' refinement. Wrapped in Golden Arc curves refined through countless iterations, Xiaomi 17 Series' form factor contributes to a comfortable, reliable in-hand feel. Thanks to elevated design and cutting-edge LIPO manufacturing techniques, ultra-thin bezels ensure Xiaomi 17 Series is both comfortable and easy to hold securely while enjoying a near-borderless display.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe thinnest and lightest Xiaomi Ultra yet,¹ Xiaomi 17 Ultra measures just 8.29mm² thick and weighs as little as 218.4g², sporting a refined, all-flat body with ultra-thin bezels and a newly repositioned, smaller, less intrusive camera deco housing. Available in White, Black, or stunning Starlit Green,³ it offers premium looks befitting a truly top-of-the-line device. Beyond its stunning appearance, Xiaomi Guardian Structure ensures robust durability with Xiaomi Shield Glass 3.0, offering 30%² greater drop resistance than Xiaomi 15 Ultra, a high-strength fiberglass back, an aluminum alloy frame, and an IP68⁶ rating for comprehensive protection against dust and moisture.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/231_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/26e7dd8221fb7003ad08f5d12a832597.jpg\" alt=\"A pair of hands holding a green smartphone, with a black background. The back of the phone has multiple cameras, featuring a modern and minimalist design.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor an even more compact imaging and technology experience, Xiaomi 17 measures at 8.06mm² in thickness and weighs just 191g², despite packing high-end computational power, advanced imaging capabilities, and a robust battery. Available in striking color options, Venture Green, Alpine Pink, Ice Blue, and classic Black,³ it features a redesigned camera deco, significantly reduced curvature in the frame transition, and ultra-slim 1.18mm bezels². In addition to a sleek, bold, visually striking design, Xiaomi 17 is built to last, with Xiaomi Guardian Structure featuring a 6M42 aluminum frame, Xiaomi Shield Glass, and IP68⁶ certification, ensuring durability and peace of mind.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/412_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/543ec7b5abbe73a83e36d7e76b49077d.jpg\" alt=\"Four smartphones are displayed side by side, in colors black, green, blue, and pink, with four lenses behind them, and the brand logo is Xiaomi. The background is a simple white.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi × Leica: A Visionary Imaging Collaboration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi continues its partnership with Leica to deliver a professional imaging experience on the Xiaomi 17 Series. Built on Leica UltraPure optical lens treatment and configuration, the Xiaomi 17 Series performs reliably across a wide range of lighting conditions, preserving detail in both bright and low-light scenes. A high-end lens configuration with multi-layer coating helps reduce reflections and optical interference, allowing cleaner light to reach the sensor. Imaging across the series is supported by tools such as AI Creativity Assistant and Xiaomi HyperConnect features, including file sharing and Multicam setup, enabling a more flexible shooting and editing workflow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/67_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/f4ed2b9dc7b7f74569b751d8a92ca609.jpg\" alt=\"The internal structure of a green mobile phone is clearly visible, showcasing multiple transparent lenses and complex circuit designs, with a black background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEngineered for powerful, versatile image capture, Xiaomi 17 Ultra breaks new ground with Xiaomi's first 1\" LOFIC main camera sensor. The Light Fusion 1050L image sensor uses cutting-edge capacitor technology to significantly increase full-well capacity and enable next-generation HDR performance. Another key breakthrough is the Leica 200MP 75–100mm camera, featuring a 75–100mm mechanical optical zoom. Built to Leica APO optical references, the telephoto camera maintains high image quality with minimal ghosting and colour fringing across the entire zoom range, and expands to a 400mm (17.2x) equivalent focal length thanks to advanced sensor technology for outstanding long-range photography. In addition to its advanced still photography capabilities, Xiaomi 17 Ultra offers ultra-dynamic videography with cinema-grade recording, color, and stabilization features, including Dolby Vision® or ACES Log recording at up to 4K 120fps on both the main and telephoto cameras.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile, the Xiaomi 17 compact imagery flagship boasts a versatile imaging system, centered around the top-of-the-line Light Fusion 950 image sensor with a 1/1.31\" size and 2.4μm 4-in-1 Super Pixel, delivering an impressive 13.5EV high dynamic range for rich, true-to-life images in any lighting. Complementing this is a Leica 60mm floating telephoto lens, offering 60mm portrait photography, 5x optical-level zoom, precise 10cm macro, and 20x AI Ultra Zoom. For self-portraits, a new 50MP front camera features improved autofocus at both short and long distances. Videography is equally robust, supporting 4K 60fps Dolby Vision® and 4K 60fps Log recording for crisp detail, consistent color, and impressive stability, enhancing clarity and streamlining workflow for professional-grade capture.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/261_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/caf22f34c5eb65551b404b43e5027d20.jpg\" alt=\"A set of two cameras, the black camera features a red button, while the other one has a silver design. Both have circular lenses, with a white background.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the spirit of Leica's rich photography legacy, Xiaomi 17 Ultra's industry-leading camera system can be further enhanced with two upgraded photography add-ons. The new Xiaomi 17 Ultra Photography Kit features a significantly lighter, more compact design, including a wrist strap, a customizable two-stage shutter, a dedicated video button, and an IP54¹⁴ rating, all inspired by professional cameras and available in various colors. For dedicated enthusiasts, the Xiaomi 17 Ultra Photography Kit Pro elevates the experience with a premium, slip-resistant PU leather grip reminiscent of iconic Leica bodies, an integrated 2000mAh (typ) battery, a detachable shutter button for customized ergonomics, and a unique Fastshot mode UI, offering comprehensive control for professional shooting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElite Performance Meets Cutting-Edge Power\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBehind each member of Xiaomi 17 Series lies the industry-leading Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 Mobile Platform, delivering unmatched performance and the most advanced feature set found on a mobile SoC. The high-performance custom-built 3ʳᵈ Gen Qualcomm Oryon™ CPU, next-generation Qualcomm® Adreno™ GPU, advanced Qualcomm® Hexagon™ NPU, RAM, and storage are suited to the most demanding mobile tasks and easily meet user needs, including rapid-fire photo and video capture, high-clarity video calls, high-productivity multitasking, and resource-intensive gaming. Xiaomi 17 Series introduces up to 100W HyperCharge and,⁴ in addition, 100W PD-PPS charging, which opens up a wide range of compatible chargers.⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/893_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/0fb10ef80368665909681e431116761d.jpg\" alt=\"The smartphone is charging, the screen shows a battery level of 86.35%, the charging power is 100W, and the background is a gradient green.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi 17 Series introduces a new generation of power with its revolutionary Xiaomi Surge Battery, featuring an industry-leading 16% silicon content for remarkable energy density and longevity. Xiaomi 17 Ultra houses a massive 6000mAh (typ) battery capacity, supporting 90W wired HyperCharge and 50W wireless HyperCharge, while Xiaomi 17 boasts an even larger 6330mAh (typ) battery capacity with 100W wired HyperCharge and 50W wireless HyperCharge.⁴ These advanced battery technology contributes to the series' slim and lightweight design, ensuring a smooth, feature-packed experience with rapid power delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefined Display Technology Emphasizing Color, Clarity, and Efficiency\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEquipped with displays designed to match its imaging and performance capabilities, the Xiaomi 17 Series features custom-built OLED panels with up to 3,500 nits peak brightness, ensuring clear visibility in any lighting condition. The 1–120Hz LTPO refresh rate, combined with DC dimming, delivers smooth, comfortable visuals with minimal eye strain during extended use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe series introduces the Xiaomi-custom M10 display panel, offering higher brightness with improved power efficiency. Xiaomi 17 Ultra also debuts Xiaomi HyperRGB technology, a redesigned OLED subpixel layout that enhances clarity and further optimizes power use, reinforcing Xiaomi's reputation for sharp, vibrant displays.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroducing Leica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarking the 100-year anniversary of Leica, the company partnered with Xiaomi to bring its iconic heritage and design philosophy to a cutting-edge mobile device. This industry-first co-development places Leica's classic image capture approach at the heart of the device, combining a century of expertise with modern technology. Leica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi features a durable aluminum-alloy body with a nickel-anodized finish, reflecting Leica's heritage in every detail. On the software side, a refreshed Leica-tuned interface offers performance- and artistry-focused imaging that is intuitive and enjoyable for both casual photographers and seasoned professionals.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/986_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/e04ebde9dff90c070116a717b1957e62.jpg\" alt=\"A smartphone's front and back display, with the front showing a red wall and a hand shadow, and the back featuring a circular camera module with a \u0026quot;Leica\u0026quot; logo. The edges of the phone have a metallic feel, and the overall design is modern.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNotably, Leica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi features an innovative Leica Camera Ring, a physical dial with a knurling finish that makes it feel just like a real zoom camera in the hand. The phone also introduces Leica Essential mode, recreating the image quality and photographic style of iconic Leica cameras, including Leica M9 and Leica M3 (with MONOPAN 50 film).\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/59_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/4f32c7c3902e7b33e0ec1be1443ca7ce.jpg\" alt=\"This is a close-up of the side and back of a camera, showing the camera's lens and the brand logo \u0026quot;LEICA.\u0026quot; There are several lens components next to the lens, and the background is a gradient color.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/11_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/cee5719e6b90304e1414bb3ee8d260e2.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Series: designed for powerfully productive moments on the go\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi also announces Xiaomi Pad 8 and Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro,¹⁵ its latest line of AI-powered light productivity tablets, offering the most powerful and thinnest tablets Xiaomi has ever launched to the international market. Designed for professionals and everyday users alike, this new series combines flagship performance with sleek portability, making it an ideal companion for staying productive on the go. As part of Xiaomi's broader smart hardware ecosystem, Xiaomi Pad 8 Series inherits the cutting-edge technology developed for Xiaomi smartphones. Xiaomi Pad 8 Series comes with stunning visuals on the 11.2-inch 3.2K display,¹⁶ offering up to 800 nits¹⁸ of brightness and a buttery-smooth 144Hz refresh rate¹⁷. Whether you're diving into work, editing photos, or streaming your favorite shows, every detail comes to life with remarkable clarity and fluidity. With an ultra-thin profile of just 5.75mm and weighing only 485g,¹⁹ these tablets are built to go wherever you go, slipping easily into your bag, yet packed with power. Despite being thinner and lighter than the last generation, both models are equipped with a large 9,200mAh battery,²º offering even greater capacity for longer use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/210_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/8362f6219e613cf5dbd67bac04ac2625.jpg\" alt=\"It showcased three smartphones and a tablet, with the phones available in black, blue, and green, while the tablet displayed a vibrant screen.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRunning on Xiaomi HyperOS 3, Xiaomi Pad 8 Series offers a more elegant and refined aesthetic, PC-level productivity, and system-level intelligence powered by Xiaomi HyperAI.²¹ The new interface features updated lock screens, wallpapers, and desktop elements, all enhanced with subtle animations and customizable widgets. Beyond design, Xiaomi HyperOS 3 also empowers users to maximize productivity, enabling effortless multitasking and offering a PC-like experience. The updated split-screen layout now supports a 5:5 vertical split view, enabling users to maximize the large display for efficient multitasking, and introduces the new horizontal 1:9 split ratio for more flexible window management. Workstation Mode on Xiaomi Pad 8 Series has been upgraded, expanding the number of apps that can be retained in the Dock to display more quick-access apps. Xiaomi HyperOS 3 takes multitasking a step further by supporting PC-Level Browser on Xiaomi Pad 8 Series.³³ Featuring intuitive mouse-hover previews, right-click functionality, and an enhanced toolbar, it facilitates smoother interaction with online tools and platforms, making it easier to work, create, and collaborate across the web. Professional workflows are further supported by integrated WPS Office PC,²³ ensuring seamless compatibility with WPS Docs, WPS Slides, WPS Sheets, and WPS PDFs for document creation and editing directly on the device. These functions are specifically tailored to enhance productivity on Xiaomi devices. Additionally, Xiaomi HyperAI²¹ and enhanced interconnectivity will help boost user productivity, enabling smooth transitions between tasks, effortless collaboration across devices, and uninterrupted workflow.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt the top of the line, \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Pro\u003c/strong\u003e is powered by Snapdragon® 8 Elite Mobile Platform²⁴, offering top-tier performance for users who need to power through intensive tasks, with CPU performance increased by 81% and GPU performance boosted by 103%.³¹ With 67W HyperCharge,²º your Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro powers up quickly, whether you're at a coffee shop or in between meetings, keeping you on track without delay. A 50MP rear camera and a 32MP front camera are designed for professionals who require detailed image capture and high-quality video calls. For those with larger storage needs, this model offers up to 512GB of storage, providing ample space for extensive project files, high-res media, and apps. And, for a more versatile premium experience, Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro is also offered in a Matte Glass version with the next-gen nano-texture-etched display driven by anti-reflective coating technology,²⁵ which drastically improves sparkle resistance by 44% compared to the last generation and provides superior tactile performance,³⁸ particularly when using a stylus for creative or professional tasks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor those seeking a more streamlined yet still powerful experience, \u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Pad 8\u003c/strong\u003e, Xiaomi's most powerful standard model to date globally, offers a high-performance alternative powered by the Snapdragon® 8s Gen 4 Mobile Platform.²⁴ CPU performance increases by 32%, while GPU performance jumps by 67%,³² making it the perfect choice for users who rely on multitasking. 45W turbo charging ensures you're always ready to go,²º even during busy days. A 13MP rear camera and an 8MP front camera deliver crisp, clear visuals for everyday tasks. With up to 256GB of storage, Xiaomi Pad 8 gives users enough room for daily apps, photos, and media without the excess capacity needed for high-end projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Series introduces the all-new Xiaomi Focus Pen Pro,¹⁵ a premium stylus weighing only 17.5g.¹⁸ It features pressure-sensitive control for precise input, along with intuitive pinch and double-tap gestures for seamless interaction with documents and artwork. This series is also supported by a range of productivity accessories, including Xiaomi Pad 8 / 8 Pro Focus Keyboard, Xiaomi Pad 8 / 8 Pro Keyboard, and Xiaomi Pad 8 / 8 Pro Cover, all designed to elevate your workflow and turn tablets into powerful, all-in-one tools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/307_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/27/02/2026/cd441c39ac9c27d324c7e65691bb7875.jpg\" alt=\"Two tablets are displayed side by side. The tablet on the left is equipped with a keyboard and a stylus, and the screen shows a color gradient. The tablet on the right also comes with a keyboard, and the screen displays the \u0026quot;Xiaomi HyperAI\u0026quot; logo, featuring a modern and minimalist design overall.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo: A Hypercar Sculpted by Wind and Intelligence\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/9_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/28/02/2026/21cddab97b6334d2f8a3bb54a041b936.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a continuation of its collaboration with \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo 7\u003c/em\u003e and Polyphony Digital Inc., a subsidiary of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc., Xiaomi has unveiled its first hypercar for the renowned racing simulation platform. Following an invitation from Kazunori Yamauchi, Producer of the \u003cem\u003eGran Turismo\u003c/em\u003e series, Xiaomi joins the Vision Gran Turismo project, becoming the first technology brand to contribute to this elite virtual collection of dream cars crafted by the world's most visionary automakers. During the launch event, Tianyuan Li, Design Head of Xiaomi EV, unveiled Xiaomi Vision Gran Turismo, the 36th brand to join the project and the 51st Vision Gran Turismo concept vehicle created for the legendary franchise.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo is a concept electric hypercar sculpted by the wind. Its teardrop-shaped cockpit is embedded within a body sculpted with cutouts and airducts, forming aerodynamic channels throughout the vehicle. The signature halo-shaped taillight serves as both a visual icon and a massive air outlet. Together with innovations like the Active Wake Control System and Accretion Rims, the car achieves a drag coefficient of 0.29, downforce of -1.2, and an aerodynamic efficiency rating of 4.1 through iterative simulated testing, reaching new heights in balancing low drag and high downforce for electric hypercars.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Electric hypercars must answer a fundamental question,\" said Li. \"Do we pursue extreme low drag for straight-line speed, or maximum downforce to conquer corners? The optimal solution lies in finding the perfect balance between the two.\" This approach impressed Yamauchi: \"When I saw that Xiaomi had resolved the contradiction between low drag and high downforce, I was truly amazed.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInside, Xiaomi introduces the \"Sofa Racer\" concept. The dashboard, door panels, and seats flow together as one cohesive loop, a cocoon-like cabin that gently envelops the driver. Equipped with intelligent features including Xiaomi Pulse, which interacts with the driver through light and sound, the space creates an experience best described as racing on a sofa. True to the Xiaomi family, it is fully integrated into the \"Human x Car x Home\" smart ecosystem. Sensing the driver's state and adapting to their mood, it transforms the car from a mere tool into an intuitive companion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing Xiaomi SU7 Ultra's record-setting Nürburgring performance and its integration into Gran Turismo 7, this latest creation represents the next chapter in the collaboration. It forges a path distinct from the fuel-powered past, one that Yamauchi believes \"will become a role model for this era.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Vision Gran Turismo will be on display at Xiaomi's booth (Hall 3, 3M30) at Mobile World Congress 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 17\u003c/strong\u003e comes in 4 color options: Black, Venture Green, Alpine Pink, and Ice Blue, with 256GB and 512GB storage variants. Suggested retail prices start from  \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 999\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 17 Ultra\u003c/strong\u003e comes in 3 color options: Black, White, and Starlit Green, with 512GB and 1TB storage variants. Suggested retail prices start from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 1,499\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLeica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi\u003c/strong\u003e comes in the color of black and storage of 1TB. Suggested retail prices start from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 1,999\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 17 Ultra Photography Kit\u003c/strong\u003e comes in 3 color options: Black, White, and Purple. Suggested retail prices start from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 99.99\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 17 Ultra Photography Kit\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePro \u003c/strong\u003ecomes in color of Black. Suggested retail prices start from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 199.99\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 will be available in three color options: Pine Green, Gray, and Blue.²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Pro will be available in three color options: Pine Green, Gray, and Blue.²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Pro Matte Glass Version will be available in one color option: Gray.²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 comes with 3 storage variants, starting from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 449.9\u003c/strong\u003e.²⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 8 Pro comes with 3 storage variants, starting from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 549.9\u003c/strong\u003e.²⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMatte Glass Version is exclusively offered with Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro, available in Gray with the 12GB + 512GB configuration, starting from \u003cstrong\u003eEUR 769.9\u003c/strong\u003e.²⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoreover, users who purchase Xiaomi 17 Series in eligible markets will enjoy three exclusive benefits¹³ with no additional cost: a 3-month trial of Google AI Pro with expanded access to Google AI and 2TB of cloud storage;¹⁰ a 3-month trial of YouTube Premium,¹¹ with ad-free access and offline downloads across YouTube and YouTube Music; and a 4-month trial of Spotify Premium with ad-free listening,¹² offline downloads, and enhanced audio quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eProduct images are available via the links below:\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgA4xrh4fhW8R4wf61m_qV1CAb4beCIK-PLqjyI1MEuN4FM?e=3YmCi4\"\u003eXiaomi 17\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCcmVFncXtZTrNQPUyi5GEIAaI9amDM2EDMkutB5yrskvM?e=Qttupc\"\u003eXiaomi 17 Ultra\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgBWWS_TVcqQT6dnJsAHazc8AcUNr7xCmyaKZR1Yi1lmWSo?e=sfPlnJ\"\u003eLeica Leitzphone powered by Xiaomi\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u