fferent regions, sold separately. Xiaomi Focus Pen Pro is compatible with Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro 12.4, Xiaomi Pad 7 Series, and Xiaomi Pad 8 Series.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ The screen size of Xiaomi Pad 8 Series is about 11.2\" in the full rectangle when measured diagonally. Actual viewable area is less due to the curved corner design and measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷ The screen supports a maximum refresh rate of 144Hz. The screen refresh rate may be slightly different under different application interfaces and game image qualities. Please refer to the actual experience. 3.2K refers to the resolution of 3200 x 2136.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸ Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹ Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary. Xiaomi Pad 8 Series has a thickness of 5.75mm and a weight of 485g; Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro Matte Glass Version has a thickness of 5.80mm and a weight of 494g. The thickness measurement does not include the protrusion of the lens module. Actual values may vary slightly due to differences in test environments, test software, and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²º Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box. 9,200mAh is the typical capacity; the rated capacity is 9,000mAh.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹ Available in select regions and languages. Some features may vary by system software version, and work on compatible apps and surfaces. An internet connection is required; always check responses for accuracy. Please check your local official website for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²² Phones and tablets must be logged into the same Xiaomi account, with Bluetooth, WLAN, and \"Settings-Interconnectivity\" enabled. Availability of specific features and services may vary depending on software version, apps, and device models. Please refer to actual use. Apple devices need to have the latest version of \"Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" app installed.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²³ The WPS Office PC is only available in certain regions, and will begin to be rolled out via OTA in certain regions at the end of March 2026. The current version only supports input in English, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese. Language support is provided by third-party applications.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁴ Qualcomm®, Snapdragon®, and AdrenoTM are trademarks or registered trademarks of Qualcomm Incorporated. Snapdragon and Qualcomm-branded products are products of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁵ Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro Matte Glass Version sold separately and is only available for the specific model.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁶ Please check local sales channels for specific availability in your region.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁷ Prices listed below reflect European sales prices of the devices sold. Global prices may vary depending on VAT, taxes, and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁸ 128GB storage variant uses UFS 3.1, while 256GB and 512GB storage variants use UFS 4.0. Configurations available may differ across regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to the storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁹ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs; 200% volume boost refers to 16 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios. Please refer to the actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³º Wi-Fi connectivity (including Wi-Fi frequency bands, Wi-Fi standards, and other features as ratified in IEEE Standard 802.11 specifications) may vary based on regional availability and local network support.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³¹ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, comparisons are made against the Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro: CPU performance is based on Geekbench 6 (Multi-Core); GPU performance is based on 1440P Aztec Ruins Vulkan.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³² Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, comparisons are made against the Xiaomi Pad 7: CPU performance is based on Geekbench 6 (Multi-Core); GPU performance is based on 1440P Aztec Ruins Vulkan.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³³ The PC-Level Browser will begin to be rolled out via OTA in certain regions at the end of February 2026.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁴ AI Calculator is available in select device models. Supports coefficient balancing for equations but does not generate chemical symbols. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁵ Available on select devices, and an internet connection is required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches. Google is a trademark of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁶ Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC. Check responses. Setup is required. Compatibility and availability vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁷ The all-metal one-piece body refers specifically to the back cover of the product and does not include the camera deco, buttons, or other components.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁸ The improvement in sparkle resistance is compared against Matte Glass Version of Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro. Data is sourced from Xiaomi Labs. Actual test results may vary due to differences in test environments or conditions. Please refer to the actual product for details.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2025, the MAU reached approximately 741.7 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 1,035.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"357","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1772289014"},"common":null}